{"id":"4b6966788d04924e","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-post-theorem.md","title":"Post's Theorem","display":"thm-post-theorem — Post's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-post-theorem","aliases":["88-thm-post-theorem"],"display":"thm-post-theorem — Post's Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full]]","[[88-df-turing-jump]]","[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-post-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-post-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-post-theorem — Post's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78101abe1090034\" href=\"?note=c78101abe1090034\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54b34b456e49359d\" href=\"?note=54b34b456e49359d\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c24d037bf910fb4b\" href=\"?note=c24d037bf910fb4b\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-parameterization\">88-lem-oracle-parameterization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c78101abe1090034\" href=\"?note=c78101abe1090034\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a>；层级元组的汇总见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"54b34b456e49359d\" href=\"?note=54b34b456e49359d\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a> 在断言中定义的有限迭代，采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(0)}=\\emptyset\">\\(\\emptyset^{(0)}=\\emptyset\\)</span> 的层级起点。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m,\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_m,\\leq_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>；有限正、负神谕条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>；统一参数编译使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"c24d037bf910fb4b\" href=\"?note=c24d037bf910fb4b\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-parameterization\">88-lem-oracle-parameterization</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(A\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_m\\emptyset^{(n)})\n\\land\n(A\\in\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_T\\emptyset^{(n)})\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(A\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_m\\emptyset^{(n)})\n\\land\n(A\\in\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_T\\emptyset^{(n)})\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明纲要。对任意神谕 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为神谕的可枚举集合可通过“在输入参数的搜索成功时停机”的统一编译归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\)</span>；反向直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 半判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\)</span>，并预先计算多一归约函数。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-c.e. 集多一完备。相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的集合及其补集若均可枚举，并行搜索两边的停机证据即给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-判定程序；总 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-判定程序的两个输出则反向给出两边的枚举。</p>\n<p>从可判定层出发，对交替量词层数归纳。一次存在搜索对应相对枚举，一次全称块经取补处理；有限神谕运行只检查有限多个正、负查询，可将这些查询分别展开为上一层公式再合并量词块。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\">\\(\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\)</span> 恰为相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span> 的 c.e. 集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{n+1}^0\">\\(\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\)</span> 恰为相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span> 的可判定集，得到两条等价式。</p>\n<p>归纳中所用索引变换必须统一可计算，故这里直接引用神谕参数化引理。有限迭代记号已有独立正式定义，不再只在本文件假设或注释中临时出现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"c78101abe1090034","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full","status":"resolved","id":"54b34b456e49359d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"87fbc479272c5469","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends